 "doi": "10.5281/zenodo.16809414",
 "description": "<p>This dataset comprises principally a comprehensively annotated database of Asgard archaea proteins (proteome_database_v3.5.csv) and additional files generated by downstream analysis. These include files containing Orthofinder and Interproscan annotations/results as well as raw data files underlying these analyses.</p>\n<p>This release is associated with the pub <strong>Assembling and annotating an Asgard archaea and giant virus dataset of over 840,000 proteins</strong></p>",
